        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "رائے (rāe) is a loan from Arabic raʾy, \"opinion, view\", which reached Urdu through Persian. Its Arabic root is r-ʾ-y (Lane)."
